{
  "_readme": "Change which sound plays for an event here; no code change needed. 'sfx' and 'voice' list ids from manifest.json; when a list has several ids one is picked at random (never the same twice in a row). 'voice' is per brother (nono/fofo) and plays when that brother triggers the event. 'music' maps a music slot to a music id.",
